The '''Military Wing''' is an [[Age]]-up [[Technology (Age of Empires IV)|technology]] for the [[Abbasid Dynasty]] in ''[[Age of Empires IV]]'' that can be researched at the [[House of Wisdom]]. It advances the player to the next Age, except when researched in the [[Imperial Age (Age of Empires IV)|Imperial Age]], and adds +5,000 hit points to the House of Wisdom. Additionally, it allows the research of new technologies and spawns a group of units.

