== Changelog ==
=== {{4icons||30}} ===
* Upon release, it unlocked Camel Support, [[Camel Rider Shields]], and Boot Camp in the respective Ages. With the [[Season One Update]], it unlocks Boot Camp, Camel Rider Shields, and Camel Support in the respective Ages.

=== {{4icons|AE|30}} ===
* Originally, the wing did not grant any free units. With [[update 6.0.878]], its research also spawned military units depending on the Age in which the Military Wing is completed: one Archer and two Spearmen in the Feudal Age, two Camel Riders in the Castle Age, and three Handcannoneers in the Imperial Age. With [[patch 6.1.130]], it spawns two Archers and two Spearmen in the Feudal Age.
* With update 6.0.878, Camel Rider Shields moved from the Military Wing to the Stable and replaced with Composite Bows (from the Archery Range). Hence, it unlocks Boot Camp, Composite Bows, and Camel Support in the respective Ages.

== Campaign version ==
The House of Wisdom appears as the primary landmark in the [[The Sultans Ascend (campaign)|The Sultans Ascend]] campaign. It behaves like the Abbasid House of Wisdom, with each Wing unlocking new technologies per Age. However, the Military Wing Imperial Age technology is [[Construction Drills]] instead of Camel Support.

